## Scope note

This phase splits along `docs/context/methodology.md`'s "Browser-API work"
rule: React components (`TaskSheet.tsx`, `TodayScreen.tsx`, `ReminderForm`,
`ReminderSheet`, `ReminderRow`) are verified manually and carry no test file
of their own — that is the documented no-test-required path, not a gap. This
suite covers exactly the decidable half the plan puts in `src/shared/`, plus
the one testable Worker-side change (the sweep's payload `route` field).

